  of shape `[..., 3, M]`, with last two dimensions containing superdiagonals,
  diagonals, and subdiagonals, in order. Similarly to `sequence` format,
  elements `diagonals[..., 0, M-1]` and `diagonals[..., 2, 0]` are ignored.

